<h1>Service Area</h1>
<p class="lede">If you're within about 30 minutes of downtown Chattanooga, we've got you.</p>
<figure>
  <img src="/assets/img/service-area-map.webp" width="1280" height="1120" alt="Map of the Pest Tech service area: a roughly 30-minute radius around Chattanooga, Tennessee, covering neighborhoods from Signal Mountain and Walden down to East Ridge and Rossville, and from Lookout Mountain east to Harrison and Tyner.">
  <figcaption>Roughly a 30-minute drive from downtown, in any direction.</figcaption>
</figure>
<h2>Where we work</h2>
<p>Our sweet spot is the older neighborhoods close to downtown. A lot of our favorite customers live in Highland Park, St. Elmo, and North Chattanooga, including North Shore and Hill City, where plenty of the houses are 100 years old or close to it.</p>
<p>We also cover Brainerd, East Brainerd, Hixson, Red Bank, East Ridge, Downtown, Ridgeside, Lupton City, Ooltewah, Lookout Mountain, Signal Mountain, Walden, Soddy-Daisy, Tyner, Harrison, and the neighborhoods in between, plus a little bit of North Georgia, like Rossville and Fort Oglethorpe. In Georgia, we do regular pest control, mosquito control, and hemlock treatments, but not <a href="/termites">termite work</a>.</p>
<p>If you're not in our core service area, send us a text! We may not be nearby tomorrow, but we might be able to fit something in when we're nearby.</p>
